---
title: Frog Stretch (Inner Thigh Stretch)
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![растяжка внутренней поверхности бедра лежа](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b759f426-666d-41cb-9208-55f2915d5604)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Get onto all fours on your hands and knees, then lower down onto your forearms for support.

### Step 2
Slowly slide your knees out to the sides as wide as comfortably possible until you feel a gentle stretch along your inner thighs and hips.

### Step 3
Hold this position for the recommended amount of time (usually 15–30 seconds).

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Try to keep your inner thigh and hip muscles relaxed during the stretch.

• Breathe slowly and steadily.

• Do not force your knees too far apart—stretch only within a comfortable, pain-free range.
{{< /callout >}}
